[whistle blows]

266
00:18:26,961 --> 00:18:28,963
[Takao] They've given up
on feeling emotions,

267
00:18:29,797 --> 00:18:32,383
but will they belittle me as "a pervert"?

268
00:18:35,428 --> 00:18:38,180
Trapped with those numb bastards...

269
00:18:38,764 --> 00:18:40,349
left to rot, with nowhere to go...

270
00:18:42,935 --> 00:18:44,812
I won't let that happen to me.

271
00:18:48,357 --> 00:18:52,361
[laughter]

272
00:18:53,362 --> 00:18:54,655
[Takao] I'm going to do this.

273
00:18:56,532 --> 00:18:59,285
A place that will make Nakamura laugh.

274
00:19:01,746 --> 00:19:03,038
That's going to be...

275
00:19:03,122 --> 00:19:05,499
GIRLS' CHANGING ROOM

276
00:19:05,583 --> 00:19:06,959
"the other side" for me.

277
00:19:12,923 --> 00:19:14,049
[♪ music fades]

278
00:19:14,133 --> 00:19:17,303
[indistinct chatter, laughter]

279
00:19:17,386 --> 00:19:19,472
You guys, my panties are gone.

280
00:19:19,555 --> 00:19:21,307
[girls exclaiming]

281
00:19:21,390 --> 00:19:22,725
[Ai] What? No way.

282
00:19:22,808 --> 00:19:24,101
[girl] Mine are gone, too.

283
00:19:24,185 --> 00:19:26,812
[girls chattering, exclaiming]

284
00:19:26,896 --> 00:19:28,564
Are yours missing, too, Nanako?

285
00:19:29,482 --> 00:19:31,275
What? Yeah.

286
00:19:31,358 --> 00:19:32,943
-[Ai] I wonder who did it.
-[Nanako] Right?

287
00:19:33,027 --> 00:19:34,028
[excited chatter]
STYLE
::cue()

288
00:20:00,387 --> 00:20:01,388
I've been waiting.

289
00:20:40,386 --> 00:20:41,679
Nakamura.

290
00:20:42,805 --> 00:20:43,806
This space...

291
00:20:44,974 --> 00:20:46,058
Just this space

292
00:20:46,725 --> 00:20:48,978
will be "the other side" within this town.

293
00:20:50,271 --> 00:20:51,939
Come here whenever you want.

294
00:20:53,023 --> 00:20:55,693
Even if we can't get out of this town,

295
00:20:55,776 --> 00:20:58,737
I'll make sure you're never bored.

296
00:21:02,658 --> 00:21:05,703
THE FLOWERS OF EVIL

297
00:21:08,706 --> 00:21:10,833
You just sit here, Nakamura.

298
00:21:13,294 --> 00:21:14,628
That's the contract...

299
00:21:15,838 --> 00:21:16,964
I'll make with you.

300
00:21:27,558 --> 00:21:30,227
You're talking
like you've got it all figured out...

301
00:21:30,936 --> 00:21:33,147
You've got some nerve to steal mine, too.

302
00:21:34,440 --> 00:21:36,734
The only one you didn't take
was Nanako Saeki's.

303
00:21:37,318 --> 00:21:38,694
Why?

304
00:21:40,821 --> 00:21:41,864
Because...

305
00:21:42,615 --> 00:21:44,909
that's the worst thing I could do.

306
00:22:00,382 --> 00:22:02,259
[♪ dramatic music playing]

307
00:22:08,265 --> 00:22:09,642
Don't be ridiculous.

308
00:22:11,018 --> 00:22:13,771
I'm letting you make a contract with me,

309
00:22:16,482 --> 00:22:18,567
you absolute pervert.

310
00:22:29,620 --> 00:22:30,829
Do I make myself clear?

311
00:22:33,248 --> 00:22:34,249
Yeah!

312
00:22:38,629 --> 00:22:39,964
[♪ music fades]

313
00:22:40,047 --> 00:22:41,048
[Ai] Nanako!

314
00:22:42,466 --> 00:22:45,302
[Nanako sobbing]
Ai... Sorry for calling all of a sudden.

315
00:22:46,011 --> 00:22:47,388
It's just...

316
00:22:48,722 --> 00:22:50,474
I'm a weak human being.

317
00:22:51,058 --> 00:22:53,310
[♪ closing theme music playing]

318
00:22:58,482 --> 00:23:00,693
I can't... [sniffles]

319
00:23:05,739 --> 00:23:08,534
carry it all on my own, anymore...

320
00:23:10,369 --> 00:23:12,788
TO BE CONTINUED

321
00:23:47,948 --> 00:23:48,991
ON THE NEXT EPISODE

322
00:23:49,074 --> 00:23:51,785
[narrator] Kasuga and Nakamura
make a secret plan,

323
00:23:51,869 --> 00:23:55,080
and jealousy bursts into bloom
in Saeki's heart as she finds out.

324
00:23:55,664 --> 00:23:57,374
Next, on episode six,

325
00:23:57,458 --> 00:24:01,045
Saeki's madness burns
all of Kasuga's hopes to the ground.

326
00:24:01,128 --> 00:24:02,880
Translated by Yuka Kristi

